# CODEOWNERS — claude_md
#
# This repo defines how 9 developers and their agents understand 89 repositories.
# A wrong line here propagates to every session on the team, so every change is reviewed.
#
# Review is owned by @MedocHealth/claudeowner. Anyone may open a PR; a member of that team
# approves.
#
# PRECONDITION: the team must exist AND have write access to this repository. GitHub
# silently ignores a CODEOWNERS line naming a team that lacks write access — no reviewer is
# assigned and no error is shown. Verify once, in the repo's Settings > Collaborators and
# teams, or via: gh api orgs/MedocHealth/teams/claudeowner/repos/MedocHealth/claude_md

# Default owner for everything in this repo.
*                       @MedocHealth/claudeowner

# Highest blast radius, called out so the intent survives a future split:
#   repos.yaml       — one edit rewrites 89 repositories' CLAUDE.md
#   managed-policy/  — changes the rules on every developer machine (and must be
#                      re-deployed by hand; it does not reach anyone via git pull)
#   scripts/         — the generator and the pre-commit guard
/repos.yaml             @MedocHealth/claudeowner
/managed-policy/        @MedocHealth/claudeowner
/scripts/               @MedocHealth/claudeowner

# Reference material — same owner today. If you later want a wider set of approvers here
# than on the three paths above, split this into a second team.
/brain/                 @MedocHealth/claudeowner
/WORKSPACE-MAP.md       @MedocHealth/claudeowner
